# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# More calendar — 仓库忽略规则 / repository ignore rules
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- 构建产物 / Build artifacts -------------------------------------------
build/
.build/
02_Developer_Source/build/
02_Developer_Source/.build/
.swiftpm/
*.o
*.dSYM

# --- 本地备份与归档 / Local archives --------------------------------------
# 源码与旧版本备份，体积大且属于个人归档，不进入版本库
03_Backup_Archives/

# --- 发布产物 / Release artifacts -----------------------------------------
# 可重新构建的二进制包；GitHub Release 单独上传
MoreCalendar_v*.zip
01_User_Delivery/*.zip

# --- 日志与运行时数据 / Logs and runtime data -----------------------------
# 自测日志、应用日志、导出数据。可能含本机路径或用户数据
*.log
*.jsonl
*.csv
02_Developer_Source/build/

# --- 密钥与凭证 / Secrets --------------------------------------------------
# 本项目的 API Key 只存 macOS Keychain，绝不应出现在仓库里
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
secrets*
*_secret*
!*.example

# --- Google OAuth 客户端凭据 / Google OAuth client -------------------------
# 用户自备的桌面端 OAuth 凭据。虽然 Google 对 installed app 的 client_secret
# 不作机密对待，但**绝不入库**：一旦提交，历史里就再也删不干净。
google_client_secret.json
*client_secret*.json
# 也不要把凭据塞进 App 资源目录，避免随 Release zip 分发
**/Resources/google_client_secret.json
**/Resources/*client_secret*.json

# --- macOS / Xcode ---------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/

# --- 编辑器 / Editors ------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
